      "y": 202.75,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 84.50000000000001,
      "text": "Multi-Head Dimension Regression Head\n\u2022 Dense(1032 -> 256) -> BatchNorm -> ReLU\n\u2022 Predicts physical tape circumferences:\n  [waist_cm, hip_cm, chest_cm]\n\u2022 NO synthetic BMI or fake body-fat labels!",
