    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_id_969252",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 504.3,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 101.4,
      "text": "Clinical Central-Adiposity Index Derivation\n\u2022 WHR = waist / hip\n\u2022 WHtR = waist / height\n\u2022 Body Roundness Index (BRI):\n  BRI = 364.2 - 365.5 * sqrt(1 - (w/(2pi))^2 / (0.5*H)^2)\n\u2022 Direct anatomical math: zero black-box fiction",
      "originalText": "Clinical Central-Adiposity Index Derivation\n\u2022 WHR = waist / hip\n\u2022 WHtR = waist / height\n\u2022 Body Roundness Index (BRI):\n  BRI = 364.2 - 365.5 * sqrt(1 - (w/(2pi))^2 / (0.5*H)^2)\n\u2022 Direct anatomical math: zero black-box fiction",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
