      "text": "NLF (Neural Localizer Fields) 3D Recovery\n\u2022 Front RGB -> 3D Joint Localizer\n\u2022 Fits SMPL-X parameters (betas, pose, trans)\n\u2022 Reconstructs personalized 3D mesh:\n  Vertices V in R^(10475 x 3), Faces F",
