    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "id_703455",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 1212,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 65,
      "text": "1. Dimension-First Grounding: Supervised exclusively on real physical tape circumferences \u2014 never synthetic BMI or unanchored body-fat %.\n2. Zero-Fiction Adiposity Indices: Central-adiposity biomarkers (WHR, WHtR, BRI) derived arithmetically from physical dimensions and height.\n3. SMPL-X Render-Back Abstention Gate: Replaces silent hallucinated outputs with active geometry verification (IoU & Chamfer distance).\n4. Strict Subject-Disjoint Integrity: Guaranteed 70/15/15 subject partitioning preventing cross-capture identity and posture leakage.",
      "originalText": "1. Dimension-First Grounding: Supervised exclusively on real physical tape circumferences \u2014 never synthetic BMI or unanchored body-fat %.\n2. Zero-Fiction Adiposity Indices: Central-adiposity biomarkers (WHR, WHtR, BRI) derived arithmetically from physical dimensions and height.\n3. SMPL-X Render-Back Abstention Gate: Replaces silent hallucinated outputs with active geometry verification (IoU & Chamfer distance).\n4. Strict Subject-Disjoint Integrity: Guaranteed 70/15/15 subject partitioning preventing cross-capture identity and posture leakage.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
